<title>BAHRAIN: PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Jan 6.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Bahraini press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>GULF DAILY NEWS</p>
<p>- Gulf Arab labour minister meet in Bahrain on Monday for talks on finding more jobs for their citizens.</p>
<p>AL-AYAM</p>
<p>- Gulf Arab foreign ministers to meet in Riyadh on Tuesday to discuss Bahrain-Qatar border dispute.</p>
<p>- Gulf Arab states invest $6.1 billion in petrochemical industries, study says. REUTER</p>
<p>	  message cancelled by sender</p>
